# HUD_PlayerOut: the two panels no corpus frame shows when a player is out while the other plays
# on (ruling 5, 2), at its first call (a player has lost the last life), the other record in play
# (+$25 bit 0). boss_time: joining locked (g_JoinLocked, HUD_LockJoin's BOSS TIME: the player
# fell during a boss fight) with credits left: script $11012. no_credits: every credit used
# (g_Credits 0, the joins and continues take them): script $10FB2.

case boss_time
b $FFFFF675 = 1
b $FFFFF6B5 = 1
w $FFFFF64E = 3
b $FFFFF4EB = $FF

case no_credits
b $FFFFF675 = 1
b $FFFFF6B5 = 1
w $FFFFF64E = 0
b $FFFFF4EB = 0
